    "title": "PHOTOS: First Concept Art of Glob Theater Lobby in Updated Monstropolis Preview Center at Disney's Hollywood Studios - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Shannen Ace ,\n1 days ago The preview center for Walt Disney World’s new lands has been updated, including never-before-seen concept art for Monstropolis. The preview center opened last year inside Walt Disney Presents at Disney’s Hollywood Studios with concept art for Monstropolis, Tropical Americas, and Piston Peak National Park gathered around the Tropical Americas model. Piston Peak has been replaced by Carousel of Progress artwork, models, and costumes while the Monstropolis section has new art and maquettes. Read full article",
